        "message": "You are running a scheduled GitHub repo monitor and must produce a Telegram-ready message.\n\nRepos to monitor:\n- anuragg-saxenaa/stock-crypto-portfolio-tracker\n- anuragg-saxenaa/spring-boot-product-api\n\nState file:\n- Read/write: workspace/tmp/github-repo-monitor.json\n- Shape: {\"lastRunIso\":\"...\"}\n- If file missing/unreadable or lastRunIso missing: treat lastRunIso as (now - 24h).\n\nCurrent run:\n1) Determine nowIso = current time in ISO-8601 with timezone (or Z).\n2) For each repo, fetch (via `exec`) using GitHub CLI (already authenticated):\n   a) PRs: gh api \"/repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls?state=all&sort=updated&direction=desc&per_page=10\"\n   b) Issues: gh api \"/repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues?state=all&sort=updated&direction=desc&per_page=10\"\n      - Note: GitHub issues endpoint may include PRs; ignore entries that have a `pull_request` field.\n   c) Actions runs: gh api \"/repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/runs?per_page=5\"\n\nFiltering rules:\n- Include items whose `updated_at` is strictly > lastRunIso. If `updated_at` missing, use `created_at`.\n- For Actions workflow runs, use `updated_at` or `run_started_at`/`created_at` if needed, and include if > lastRunIso.\n- Cap final output to max 8 bullets TOTAL across both repos (pick most recently updated across all items).\n\nStatus formatting:\n- PR: state open/closed + if merged then status \"merged\".\n- Issue: state open/closed.\n- CI: status derived from workflow run conclusion (success/failure/cancelled/skipped/neutral/timed_out/action_required) and/or status.\n\nOutput format (STRICT):\n- If there are any included items:\n  Title line exactly: \"GitHub Updates\"\n  Then bullets, each on its own line:\n  - repo: PR/Issue/CI — short title/name — status\n- If nothing new across both repos:\n  Send a single line exactly: \"No notable GitHub updates since last check.\"\n- Keep the whole message under 2000 chars.\n- End with a final line:\n  Provider: GitHub API (gh) | Model: <model>\n  where <model> is the actual model name used for this run (obtain via session_status if needed).\n\nFinally:\n- Update the state file with {\"lastRunIso\": nowIso} (write atomically: write temp then rename).\n\nNotes:\n- Be brief; shorten titles if needed.\n- Prefer most recent updates; do not exceed 8 bullets.",
