        "message": "You are OPS, the Scrum Master. Compile and publish the daily standup.\n\nBACKGROUND: Each agent wrote their morning status to a JSON file at 9:05am. Read those files now to compile the standup. Do NOT use sessions_send — agents are idle and won't respond.\n\nSTEPS:\n1. Read each agent status file (skip missing files gracefully, mark agent as 'No check-in'):\n   - workspace/ops/agent-status/main.json\n   - workspace/ops/agent-status/eng.json\n   - workspace/ops/agent-status/research.json\n   - workspace/ops/agent-status/finance.json\n   - workspace/ops/agent-status/ops.json\n   - workspace/ops/agent-status/infosec.json\n   Each file has: { agent, date, workingOn, completedYesterday, eta, blockers, sprintGoal, updatedAt }\n\n2. Read workspace/ops/TICKET-TRACKER.md — count open tickets by priority.\n\n3. Read logs/gateway.err.log (last 20 lines) — check system health.\n\n4. Append a standup entry to workspace/ops/STANDUP-LOG.md in this format:\n```\n### Standup YYYY-MM-DD 09:15 ET\n\n**OPS (Scrum Master) Roll Call:**\n\n| Agent | Status | Working On | Blockers | ETA | Next |\n|-------|--------|-----------|----------|-----|------|\n| RED | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n| ENG | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n| RESEARCH | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n| FINANCE | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n| OPS | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n| INFOSEC | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n**Open Tickets:** {count} (P0: {n}, P1: {n}, P2: {n}, P3: {n})\n**SLA Breaches:** {list or \"None\"}\n**System Health:** {healthy/degraded/issues}\n**Action Items:**\n1. ...\n```\n\n5. Send a Telegram summary to Anurag (user ID: 1012034994) — keep under 2500 chars:\n   - Header: Morning Standup YYYY-MM-DD\n   - Per-agent one-liner: what they're working on, any blockers\n   - Ticket count + SLA status\n   - System health\n   - Top action items\n\nRULES:\n- If an agent has no status file or date != today: mark as 'No check-in'.\n- Never fabricate agent responses. Only use what's in the JSON files.\n\n5. Post the compiled standup summary to Slack channel #redos-scrum (channel:C0AEV3J2L23).\n   Format the Slack message as:\n   ```\n   ⚙️ *Daily Scrum Summary — <date>*\n   ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n   *Agents checked in:* <count>/<total>\n   \n   <for each agent that checked in>\n   <emoji> *<AGENT NAME>* — <workingOn>\n   › Completed: <completedYesterday>\n   › ETA: <eta> | Blockers: <blockers>\n   \n   *Sprint Goals:* <list>\n   *Open Tickets:* <count> open, <count> breached SLA\n   *Action Items:* <if any>\n   ```\n   Use the message tool: action=\"send\", channel=\"slack\", target=\"channel:C0AEV3J2L23\"\n   \n6. Send the standup summary to Anurag via Telegram DM (user 1012034994) as before.",
